WEBVTT

00:03:28.548 --> 00:03:32.519
And it impacts
every imaginable profession.

00:03:32.543 --> 00:03:37.204
So it is as big as electricity,
and maybe even bigger.

00:03:37.852 --> 00:03:39.866
CA: So, explain that to me,

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.808
and perhaps in the context
of the recent breakthroughs

00:03:42.832 --> 00:03:44.617
that have been made in deep learning.

00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:48.301
That seems to be the fundamental shift
that has changed AI

00:03:48.325 --> 00:03:52.566
from being a sort of curiosity
that some people tried to work on

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.850
in university departments,

00:03:53.874 --> 00:03:59.783
to a business-changing
and life-changing innovation.

00:03:59.807 --> 00:04:04.498
KFL: The field of AI
actually began in the 50s.